    "updated_at": "2019-12-05T16:40:58Z",
    "body": "FYI for other spec owners: we will need to rewrite the dependency on user activation using [the new classification](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#user-activation-gated-apis) as a guide.\r\n\r\nHere is a quick rule of thumb, but each spec still needs a careful look for corner cases: most other specs we checked refer to the old model using something like \"allow the API when triggered by user activation/user gesture\"; we will need to replace the phrase with \"allow the API when (_a specific_) `Window` has transient or sticky user activation\".  (In a few cases we may also need to add \"...then consume the user activation\").\r\n\r\nPlease reach out to us (@domenic or me) for API specific guidance.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
