    "body": "Ok, so, might be good to add a note that Editor's don't need to check for \"expired\"...  I definitely think we should provide guidance on getting the Window object from inside a method. \r\n\r\nI reached for:\r\n\r\n> Let |window| be the [=relevant global object=] of the [=environment settings object/responsible document=].\r\n\r\nBut I'm unsure if that's \"best practice\"™️. \r\n",
